 },
 {
  "table": "cust_behavior_snapshot",
  "column": "as_of",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 行为快照基准日（通常为月末）。why_this_way: days_since_* 都是相对该基准日计算，instant 绑定按该列落窗。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "cust_behavior_snapshot",
  "column": "created_at",
  "comment": ""
 },
 {
  "table": "cust_behavior_snapshot",
  "column": "customer_no",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 客户号，RFM-R 的最小观察单元。why_this_way: 001/005 按客户输出最近行为距今天数，实体列必须是客户号。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "cust_behavior_snapshot",
  "column": "data_source",
  "comment": ""
 },
 {
  "table": "cust_behavior_snapshot",
  "column": "days_since_last_behavior",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 基准日−最近一次有效行为日，未发生为 NULL。why_this_way: 001 直接取该列；NULL 不置 0，避免把“从未行为”误判为“今天活跃”。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "cust_behavior_snapshot",
  "column": "days_since_proxy_event",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 无交易客户的代理事件（注册/开卡/首单/保单生效）距基准日天数。why_this_way: 005 的 R 用代理事件日；与 days_since_last_behavior 分开，避免两种口径混算。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "cust_behavior_snapshot",
  "column": "fixture",
  "comment": ""
 },
 {
  "table": "cust_behavior_snapshot",
  "column": "institution",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 归属机构代码。why_this_way: 支持按机构汇总客户行为；当前绑定按客户输出。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "cust_behavior_snapshot",
  "column": "last_behavior_date",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 最近一次有效行为日（交易/还款/缴费/保单生效）。why_this_way: 保留原始日期，便于核对 days_since_last_behavior。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "cust_behavior_snapshot",
  "column": "last_txn_date",
