  "table": "ins_persistence_stat",
  "column": "due_vehicle_count",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 到期应续保车辆数（按车辆/VIN 去重，含脱保车辆）。why_this_way: 024 车险续保率分母。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_persistence_stat",
  "column": "first_year_premium",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 该 cohort 首个保单年度实收规模保费（按保单号去重，已剔除趸交/撤单/终止等）。why_this_way: 022/023 的分母固定为 cohort 首年实收保费。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_persistence_stat",
  "column": "fixture",
  "comment": ""
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_persistence_stat",
  "column": "institution",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 保险机构代码。why_this_way: cohort 可跨机构汇总；保留机构列支持机构级继续率。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_persistence_stat",
  "column": "product",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 险种/产品代码。why_this_way: 022/023/024 按产品分组输出，是绑定实体列。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_persistence_stat",
  "column": "renewal_year",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 观察的是第几个保单年度（2=13 个月继续率，3=25 个月继续率；车险为 1）。why_this_way: 同一 cohort 的 13/25 个月继续率放在同一表按 renewal_year 区分。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_persistence_stat",
  "column": "renewed_premium",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 该 cohort 第 N 个保单年度首期实收规模保费（宽限或自然月口径）。why_this_way: 继续率分子；与 first_year_premium 同 cohort 同口径。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_persistence_stat",
  "column": "renewed_vehicle_count",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 到期车辆中实际在本司续保的车辆数。why_this_way: 024 车险续保率分子。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_persistence_stat",
  "column": "valuation_basis",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 评价口径：grace 宽限期 / natural 自然月 / vehicle_renewal 车险续保队列。why_this_way: 022-v1/v2、023-v1/v2 必须并列可追溯，不能合并成一个“继续率”列。basis: industry"
 },
