 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "beginning_reserve_total",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 期初长期险责任准备金（019 为本期期初；020 为上年末）。why_this_way: 退保率分母含期初余额，不能只用本期保费。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "business_line",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 业务大类：property 财产险 / life 寿险 / health 短期健康险 / other。why_this_way: 008/011/013/027 限定财产险、009 限定短期健康险、019/020 限定长期险，用业务大类过滤比用具体产品码更稳定。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "ceded_premium",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 分出保费。why_this_way: 009 再保后已赚、010 已赚保费都要从保费中扣分出。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "channel",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 销售渠道代码；无渠道归属时填 '-'。why_this_way: 026 渠道费用率与 028 手续费占比按渠道分组，'-' 表示该行不参与渠道口径。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "claim_reserve_change",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 未决赔款准备金变动（本期提取−转回，可为负）。why_this_way: 综合赔付率必须含未决变动，否则跨期赔付被低估。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "collected_premium",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 实收保费=本期保费收款−本期批退/退费（收付实现制）。why_this_way: 003 与 006 的实际完成额都按实收口径可加总；批退跨期冲减留在本列，不拆表。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "commission_expense",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 手续费及佣金支出。why_this_way: 028 单独衡量渠道成本结构，不能直接复用费用合计。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "created_at",
  "comment": ""
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "current_term_premium",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 本年度签单保费（019）/本年长期险保费收入（020）。why_this_way: 退保率分母的“本年保费”与签单/实收口径不同，单列以便两种退保率并存。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "data_source",
  "comment": ""
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "earned_premium",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 已赚保费。why_this_way: 009 再保后已赚、010 财政部口径直接使用已赚保费。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "expense_total",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 费用合计=业务及管理费+手续费佣金+分保费用+税金等。why_this_way: 011 综合成本率、026 渠道费用率、027 综合费用率的分子统一用费用合计。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "fixture",
  "comment": ""
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "institution",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 保险机构代码，期间统计主体。why_this_way: 011/019/027 等机构级指标按该列分组；产品/渠道行再汇总到机构。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "long_term_reserve_change",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 长期财产险责任准备金提转差。why_this_way: 013 旧规两年赔付率的分子分母都要加回长期责任准备金提转差。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "paid_claims",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 赔付支出（本期实际支付赔款）。why_this_way: 008/009/010/011/013 的分子都从赔付支出出发。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "period_end",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 统计期截止日，也是绑定窗口的业务时间列。why_this_way: 编译器按 period_end 落窗后对组成项求和，天然支持月/季/年多粒度。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "period_start",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 统计期起始日。why_this_way: 期间事实必须能还原“同期”；period_end 用于落窗，period_start 用于核对。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "plan_premium",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 计划保费（同期、同口径、锁定计划版本）。why_this_way: 006 分母只能来自预算/计划系统，不能由实际保费推算。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "policyholder_deposit_beginning",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 保户储金及投资款期初余额。why_this_way: 019 现行口径的分母还要加保户储金及投资款，单列避免与责任准备金混算。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "product",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 险种/产品代码；无产品归属时填 '-'。why_this_way: 008/013/027 需要限定财产险，product 与 business_line 同时保存便于下钻。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "reinsurance_recoverable",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 摊回赔款/摊回保险责任准备金。why_this_way: 008/009/011/013 要求“扣摊回”，故以正数保存、公式中相减。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "reinsurance_reserve_change",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 摊回保险责任准备金变动（本期摊回−转回，可为负）。why_this_way: 009 再保后已赚保费=已赚−分出+摊回责任准备金变动，必须单列才能与摊回赔款区分。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "retained_premium",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 自留保费=原保险保费−分出保费。why_this_way: 008/011/013/027 的分母都从自留保费出发，避免每次用两张表相减。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "separate_account_beginning",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 独立账户负债期初余额。why_this_way: 019 投资型业务退保率的分母包含独立账户负债。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "signed_premium",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 签单保费（含已起保与未起保，批增批减调整，退保不冲减）。why_this_way: 006 计划达成、026 渠道费用率、028 手续费占比的分母都要求“签单/保费收入”口径。basis: industry"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "surrender_amount",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 退保金（长期险及投资型业务退保给付）。why_this_way: 019/020 的分子都是退保金，与赔付支出分开保存。basis: regulatory"
 },
 {
  "table": "ins_underwriting_stat",
  "column": "unearned_reserve_change",
  "comment": "business_meaning: 未到期责任准备金变动/提转差（本期提取−本期转回，可为负）。why_this_way: 自留保费扣未到期准备金变动才等于当期承保口径；允许负值以支持转回。basis: regulatory"
 },
